From: Oliver Sargison <sarol263@student.otago.ac.nz>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:14:49 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] Plutonium: list agent-launched native windows under
 their thread

Agents get PLUTONIUM_THREAD_ID and the Exo display when PLUTONIUM_WAYLAND_DISPLAY is set; /api/plutonium/window-threads maps client pids to threads; the web app lists each thread's windows in the sidebar and embeds one in a pane when running as the Plutonium shell.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
